    "spread_how": "The two-ulp SIGMA_8 selfcheck changed powers by below 7e-7. A one-thread run changes the random realization: mode-weighted low-k density, 1LPT and 2LPT power changed by 3.3--20.2%, while density--1LPT coherence changed below 4.9e-4, transfer below 0.73%, and longitudinal ratios below 1.1%. Flipping the x 1LPT sign failed at 646x the bound; zeroing all 2LPT components failed at 10x and also produced an undefined longitudinal ratio.",
